  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><strong><em><u>立即遊玩此模組包！ <a style=\"color:#f1c40f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/backrooms-lost-found-footage-blff\" rel=\"nofollow\">Backrooms Lost Found Footage (BLFF) - Minecraft 模組包 - CurseForge</a></u></em></strong></span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://url-shortener.curseforge.com/YUKZE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1302460/description_f04e587f-e414-46fe-b782-6d07fbfdda1f.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"425\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>一個過度擁擠且規模龐大的村莊！</p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#e03e2d\"><em><strong>已知問題：</strong></em></span></p><p><em>部分建築上會生成地形</em></p><p><em>建築之間可能互相穿透</em></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#f00\"><em><strong>特色功能：</strong></em></span></p><p><em><span style=\"color:#000\">村莊橫跨世界數百格範圍</span></em></p><p><em><span style=\"color:#000\">集結多種不同類型的村莊於一體</span></em></p>",
